{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34174","headline":"奉和袭美太湖诗二十首 崦里 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美太湖诗二十首 崦里","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山横路若绝，转檝逢平川。\n川中水木幽，高下兼良田。\n沟塍堕微溜，桑柘含疎烟。\n处处倚蚕箔，家家下鱼筌。\n騃犊卧新𦬻，野禽争折莲\n试招搔首翁，共语残阳边。\n今来九州内，未得皆恬然。\n贼阵始吉语，狂波又凶年。\n吾翁欲何道，守此常安眠。\n笑我掉头去，芦中闻刺船。\n余知隐地术，可以齐真仙。\n终当从之游，庶复全於天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34174.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34174","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}